{"version":1,"content":"<p>中新網今（20日）報道，中國駐菲律賓大使井泉周一（19日）應約會見菲律賓外長拉扎羅，就近期菲方官員及政客斷章取義、污蔑抹黑中方的言論提出嚴正交涉【相關報道】。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.742761+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T02:48:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T01:37:42.749413+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684299+00:00","content_hash":"d2da28c9def35e2e2c628b4c6e33d9e3c3ea3784297bb49e8561ad5012a8c875","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}